        "description": "Production-grade HTTP Gateway Service Benchmark: Uvicorn ASGI behind NGINX Reverse Proxy over local loopback interface (127.0.0.1:8080 -> 127.0.0.1:8000). Evaluates:\n  1. Open-loop constant-arrival-rate load testing (k6) sweeping offered load to identify queue knee\n     and latency overhead over no_inspection.\n  2. Per-stage micro-profiling (parse, features, predict, enqueue) over 10k requests before/after optimization.\n  3. Replay of real CSIC 2010 traffic with real Tier 1 decisions and ER sweep (1%, 5%, 10%, 25%, 45%, empirical).\n  4. Dual escalation modes benchmark: HOLD (fail-open, fail-closed) vs ASYNC-QUARANTINE.\n  5. Rigorous mathematical blended latency validation (mean linear model, empirical mixture quantiles).\n  6. Hardware telemetry recording with core isolation and warmup discard.\n",
